# Build output and per-machine settings (patterns are relative to this file)
*.exe
pcoin-tray.cfg
pcoin-selftest.txt
# Runtime state the app writes next to itself: forwarding address and txids,
# the address book, and the wallet app's own config. Per machine, never source.
pcoin-forward.json
pcoin-addressbook.json
pcoin-wallet.cfg

# The recovery phrase and its plain-text sidecar. These belong to whoever runs
# the app on that machine and must never be committed anywhere.
pcoin-seed.dat
pcoin-seed.dat.prev
pcoin-seed.dat.tmp
pcoin-seed.info
